This is a collection of presentations delivered at ASME's International Mechanical Engineering Congress & Exposition 2026 (IMECE 2026), Vancouver Convention Centre, on November 11, 2026 (sessions 11-02-03 and 11-06-01).

- IMECE2026-192090: Complex Spectral Binding Networks for High-Entropy Fluid Dynamics: Solving the Spectral Fidelity Paradox in Atmospheric Gravity Waves
- IMECE2026-192091: A Speed-Gradient Operator for Asymptotic Static State Recovery in Unsteady Viscous Flows
